WEBVTT

00:01:28.436 --> 00:01:34.196
But I still believe that we are better off
not ignoring this industry.

00:01:34.236 --> 00:01:36.996
Let's instead try to turn it into --

00:01:37.036 --> 00:01:39.716
to help drive the change we need to see.

00:01:40.556 --> 00:01:41.996
Let me tell you why.

00:01:43.916 --> 00:01:46.156
I lead an organization that's called

00:01:46.196 --> 00:01:49.116
Oil and Gas Climate Initiative, OGCI.

00:01:49.156 --> 00:01:52.916
It brings together 12 of the largest
companies in the world,

00:01:52.956 --> 00:01:54.356
and their CEOs.

00:01:55.036 --> 00:01:58.996
The members, household names,

00:01:59.036 --> 00:02:00.756
are actually producing, every day,